\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset Caption

\begin_layout Plain Layout
As waves propagates across space, the wavelength resulting from the motion
 of the source will either stretch or contract depending on its direction
 of motion.
 (Image was taken from http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Doppler_effect_diagrammat
ic.svg on May 4, 2014.) 
